\log_{10}\left(x^4\right) &= \left(\log_{10} x\right)^3 \\
4\log_{10} x &= \left(\log_{10} x\right)^3 \\
\log_{10} x \left( \left(\log_{10} x\right)^2 - 4 \right) &= 0
\end{align*}
Since $x$ must be positive for $\log_{10} x$ to be defined, we must have
