x &= 1 \quad \text{or} \quad \log_{10} x = \pm 2 \\
x &= 1 \quad \text{or} \quad x = 10^{\pm 2}
\end{align*}
Thus, the points of intersection are $\boxed{(1,0), (100,4), \left(\frac{1}{100},-4\right)}$.
